  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   GPU-Native Scientific Computing  ·  Headless GPU Shell
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Session State & Storage:
   • ~ (home)       wallet-persistent storage volume (/home/aXonian)
   • headless       shell-only session (desktop GUI accessible via WebRTC)

  GPU & HPC System Commands:
   • nvidia-smi     monitor allocated GPU(s), VRAM & CUDA utilization
   • nvcc           NVIDIA CUDA C/C++ compiler driver
   • mpirun         OpenMPI parallel execution launcher for multi-GPU tasks

  AI / Machine Learning & Scientific Computing CLI:
   • python3        PyTorch 2.3+ CUDA runtime & AI model execution
   • jupyter-lab    launch interactive JupyterLab notebook server
   • tensorboard    start ML model training visualization & metrics server
   • Rscript        execute R statistical data processing scripts
   • octave-cli     GNU Octave numerical shell & MATLAB-compatible engine
   • gnuplot        command-line data plotting & graphing utility

  Molecular Dynamics, Quantum & Bio CLI:
   • gmx            GROMACS GPU-accelerated molecular dynamics (gmx_mpi)
   • pw.x           Quantum ESPRESSO DFT electronic-structure solver
   • pymol          PyMOL 3D molecular structure renderer & CLI tool
   • ugenecl        UGENE bioinformatics CLI for sequence workflows

  Pipelines, Spatial & Storage CLI:
   • nextflow       run containerized scientific workflow pipelines
   • grass          GRASS GIS headless spatial data processing engine
   • ipfs           IPFS peer node daemon & decentralized dataset CLI
   • syncthing      headless P2P encrypted file synchronization daemon

